# STIG AS24-U1-000930: The Apache web server must install security-relevant software updates within the
# STIG ID: V-214270 (MEDIUM)

META
    esp_id `apache-as24-u1-000930-version-patches-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `apache`
    criticality `high`
    title `STIG AS24-U1-000930: The Apache web server must install security-relevant software updates within the`
    description `The Apache web server must install security-relevant software updates within the`
    author `example-security`
    tags `apache,stig,disa-stig`
    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:AS24-U1-000930,NIST-800-53:SI-2`
    control_objective `SI-2`
    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`
    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Apache:localhost:web-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`
    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA Apache STIG guidance for AS24-U1-000930.`
    component_id `comp-apache-web`
META_END

DEF
    OBJECT httpd_pkg
        package_name `httpd`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE pkg_installed
        installed boolean = true
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN rpm_package
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF pkg_installed
            OBJECT_REF httpd_pkg
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
